<title>UK: Argentaria Capital sets $150 million step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Argentaria Capital sets $150 million step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTARIA CAPITAL FUNDING</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  CORPORACION BANCARIA DE ESPANA SA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *   FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *25 BP     PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.932    FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.932</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO FEB 2002, THEN 3ML PLUS 75 BP IF NOT CALLED AT</p>
<p>		 PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/KY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  35 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	DISCOUNT MARGIN IS 26.6 BP OVER 3ML</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
